Ta-da! And so we've arrived! Where do you think we are?!

22
00:05:13,925 --> 00:05:17,405
はい、栃木県で〜す！！いぇ〜い！！
That's right, it's Tochigi Prefecture!! Yay!!

23
00:05:18,075 --> 00:05:20,515
