いよいよ大本命！ベニズワイガニの登場！
At last, the main event! The arrival of the red snow crab!

113
00:13:39,022 --> 00:13:42,522
え～美味しそう…やっぱ足が一番美味しそう。
Ehh, looks delicious... As expected, the legs look the most delicious.

114
