179
00:17:24,524 --> 00:17:28,524
朝からスカイダイビングして、カニ小屋で美味しいカニいっぱい食べて、富山県来てね！
After skydiving since morning, eating lots of delicious crab at the crab shack, please come to Toyama Prefecture!

