224
00:25:25,940 --> 00:25:30,540
こうしちゃいられない 君と！
I can't just stand here, with you!

225
00:25:31,040 --> 00:25:36,540
引きこもりも人見知りも普段と違う顔見せてよ
Hikikomori, introverts, show me a different side than usual!

226
00:25:36,840 --> 00:25:41,840
みんな兄弟 調子どうだい なりふり構わず そう！
We're all siblings, how's it going? Without caring about appearances, that's right!

227
00:25:42,040 --> 00:25:47,840
人に笑われていてても関係ない 周りがどうとかこうとか気にしない
Even if others laugh at you, it doesn't matter. Don't care what those around you say!

228
