00:32:43,804 --> 00:32:52,504
明日の入り口に　置いて行かなくちゃいけないのかな
Do we have to leave them behind at tomorrow's doorway?

278
00:32:53,104 --> 00:33:00,204
でもね、会えたよ！すてきな天使に
But you know what? We met them! A wonderful angel...

279
00:33:00,604 --> 00:33:09,004
卒業は終わりじゃない　これからの仲間だから
Graduation isn't the end, because we'll still be friends from now on!

280
00:33:09,404 --> 00:33:16,904
一緒の写真たち　おそろのキーホルダー
Photos we took together, matching keychains

281
00:33:17,204 --> 00:33:29,904
いつまでも輝いてる　ずっとその笑顔　ありがとう
They'll shine forever, and that smile will stay forever. Thank you!

282
00:33:33,904 --> 00:33:42,204
ねぇ　桜の木もちょっと　背が伸びたみたい
Hey, it looks like the cherry blossom trees have grown a bit taller, too.

283
00:33:42,604 --> 00:33:55,104
見えないゆっくりなスピードでも　きっとあの空は見てたね
Even at an invisible, slow pace, I'm sure that sky was watching over us.

284
00:33:55,804 --> 00:34:05,004
何度もつまずいたこと　それでも最後まで歩けたこと
All the times we tripped up, and yet how we walked all the way to the end

285
00:34:05,204 --> 00:34:22,604
帰り道課外の廊下に　こぼれた音符の羽根　ふかふか積もるまで　このままでいれたらいいのにな
In the hallway after class, until the fallen feathers of melody pile up soft and deep, I wish we could stay just like this forever.

286
00:34:23,004 --> 00:34:30,504
でもね、ふれたよ！愛すべき天使に
But you know what? We touched it! A lovable angel...

287
00:34:31,004 --> 00:34:39,204
ただいまって言いたくなる　この場所は変わらないよ
Whenever you want to say "I'm home," this place will never change.

288
00:34:39,804 --> 00:34:46,904
メールの受信箱　マルしたカレンダー
Our email inbox, the circled calendar

289
00:34:47,204 --> 00:34:58,304
とびきりの夢と出会い　くれた音楽に　ありがとう
Thank you for the wonderful dreams and encounters, and the music you gave us.

290
00:35:00,112 --> 00:35:02,322
ほらね、かわらない道
See? The path hasn't changed,

291
00:35:02,322 --> 00:35:08,362
離れてても同じ空見上げて
Even apart, looking up at the same sky...

292
00:35:10,172 --> 00:35:13,172
ユニゾンで歌おう！
Let's sing in unison!

293
00:35:35,112 --> 00:35:38,092
でもね、会えたよ！
But you know, we met!

294
00:35:38,092 --> 00:35:42,932
すてきな天使に卒業は終わりじゃない
To a wonderful angel, graduation isn't the end.

295
00:35:43,132 --> 00:35:50,832
これからも仲間だから
Because we'll always be friends from now on, too!

296
00:35:51,332 --> 00:35:58,832
大好きって言うなら、大大好きって返すよ
If you say "I love you," I'll reply with "I love you so, so much!"

297
00:35:59,332 --> 00:36:09,132
忘れ物もうないよね、ずっと永遠に一緒だよ
There are no more things left behind, we'll be together forever and ever!

298
00:36:37,556 --> 00:36:45,056
[Title: メフィスト - 作詞・作曲: 女王蜂 アヴ]
[Title: Mephisto - Lyrics & Music: Ziyoou V]

299
00:37:07,362 --> 00:37:13,662
ラストチャンスに飢えたつま先が踊り出すまま駆けけたこの夜空
Running across this night sky with toes starving for a last chance just as we dance,

300
00:37:13,862 --> 00:37:16,762
並みのスタンスじゃ保たかない
An ordinary stance won't get us through.

301
00:37:16,862 --> 00:37:19,862
星は宝石の憧れ
Stars are the longing of jewels.

302
00:37:20,056 --> 00:37:28,962
浮かぶ涙と汗は血の名残り、目の中でしか泳げない芝居、だけどステージが逃がさない
Floating tears and sweat are remnants of blood, a play that can only swim within the eyes, yet the stage won't let us escape!

303
00:37:29,862 --> 00:37:34,262
いついつまでも憧れ、焦がれているよ
Yearning forever and ever, burning with longing.

304
00:37:34,462 --> 00:37:37,362
I've never seen such a liar.

305
00:37:37,362 --> 00:37:44,162
生まれつきだっての底なし、This lie is love. And this lie is a gift to the world.
Bottomless since birth. This lie is love. And this lie is a gift to the world.

306
00:37:44,262 --> 00:37:53,662
誰と生きたか思い出して、わたしが命を賭けるからあげるから
Remember who you lived with, because I will stake and give my life for you!

307
00:37:54,162 --> 00:38:00,062
あなたは時間をくれたのでしょう？
You gave me time, didn't you?

308
00:38:00,062 --> 00:38:06,062
あらゆる望みの総てを叶えたら叶えられたなら
If all my wishes were granted, if I could make them come true...

309
00:38:06,262 --> 00:38:12,162
あなたに会いたい、星に願いをかけて
I want to see you, making a wish upon a star.

310
00:38:13,162 --> 00:38:16,062
戻れないから大切にするの？
Do we cherish it because we can't go back?

311
00:38:16,062 --> 00:38:21,862
始めないなら高を括るよ、楽になる日はまず来ない
If you won't start, I'll take it easy—the day you find relief will never come.

312
00:38:21,962 --> 00:38:28,062
日々のなかに集まる哀しい光
Sad lights gathering within everyday life.

313
00:38:29,862 --> 00:38:33,662
生まれつきだっての底なし
Bottomless since birth...

314
00:38:33,662 --> 00:38:37,162
This lie is love. And this lie is a gift to the world.

315
00:38:37,162 --> 00:38:40,862
誰を生きたか忘れちゃった！
I forgot who I lived as!

316
00:39:06,162 --> 00:39:17,462
あなたに命が戻るなら届くなら、わたしはどうなろうとも構わないのに
If life returns to you, if it reaches you, I wouldn't care what happens to me, yet...

317
00:39:18,162 --> 00:39:27,762
どうやら総ては叶わない、叶わないならばあなたになりたい、星は砕け光る
It seems not everything can come true; if it cannot, I want to become you—the stars shatter and shine bright.

318
00:39:30,162 --> 00:39:36,162
わたしが命を賭けるからあげるから
Because I will stake and give my life...

319
00:39:36,462 --> 00:39:42,162
あなたは時間をくれたのでしょう？
You gave me time, didn't you?

320
00:39:42,962 --> 00:39:48,862
あらゆる望みの総てを叶えたら叶えられたなら
If all my wishes were granted, if I could make them come true...

321
00:39:48,962 --> 00:39:54,462
あなたに会いたい、星に願いをかけて
I want to see you, making a wish upon a star.

322
00:39:55,162 --> 00:40:00,056
さあ星の子たちよ、よくお眠りなさい
Now, children of the stars, sleep well.

323
00:40:00,186 --> 00:40:06,816
さあ星の子たちよ よくお眠りなさい 輝きは鈍らない あなたたちならば
Now, children of the stars, sleep soundly. Your brilliance will never dull, if it is you.

324
00:40:08,636 --> 00:40:13,316
さあ星の子たちよ よく狙いなさい
Now, children of the stars, aim well.

325
00:40:14,276 --> 00:40:22,076
またたきを許さない あなたたちならば
Showing no mercy for a single blink, if it is you.

326
00:40:36,499 --> 00:40:43,099
凍りついた心には太陽を そして僕が君にとってそのポジションを
For a frozen heart, the sun. And for you, I want to be that position.

327
00:40:44,279 --> 00:40:50,119
そんなだいぶ傲慢な思い込みをこじらせてたんだよ ごめんね
I let such arrogant presumptions twist me all up. I'm sorry.

328
00:40:51,419 --> 00:40:57,519
ごめんね 笑って 笑ってやって
I'm sorry. Please... just laugh it off.

329
00:40:59,119 --> 00:41:05,219
火傷しそうなほどのポジティブの 冷たさとう残酷さに気付いたんだよ
I realized the coldness and cruelty of a positivity so intense it could burn you.

330
00:41:06,199 --> 00:41:12,439
きっと君に渡したいものは もっとひんやり熱いもの
Surely, what I want to hand to you is something much more cool yet burning.

331
00:41:13,859 --> 00:41:20,799
綺麗事じゃないけど 綺麗で揺るぎないもの うわべよりも胸の奥の奥を温めるもの
It's not just pretty words, but something beautiful and unwavering, warming the deepest depths of the heart rather than just the surface.

332
00:41:21,119 --> 00:41:26,619
理想だけはあるけど 心のどこを探しても まるで見つからないんだよ
I have ideals, but no matter where I search in my heart, I just can't seem to find them.

333
00:41:27,179 --> 00:41:33,519
伝えたい 伝わらない その不条理が今 キツく縛り付けるんだよ
What I want to convey, what won't get across—that absurdity is binding me tightly right now.

334
00:41:35,859 --> 00:41:43,119
臆病な僕の この一挙手一投足を
My cowardly every gesture and movement...

335
00:41:44,319 --> 00:41:51,219
言葉はまるで雪の結晶 君にプレゼントしたくても 夢中になればなるほどに
Words are just like snowflakes. Even if I want to present them to you, the more engrossed I get...

336
00:41:52,619 --> 00:41:58,779
形は崩れ落ちて溶けていって 消えてしまうけど
Their shape crumbles, melts away, and disappears.

337
00:41:59,279 --> 00:42:05,839
でも僕が選ぶ言葉が そこに託された想いが
But the words I choose, the feelings entrusted within them...

338
00:42:06,079 --> 00:42:16,339
君の胸を震わすのを 諦められない 愛してるよりも愛が届くまで
I cannot give up on making your heart tremble. Until my love reaches you, even more than saying I love you.

339
00:42:20,099 --> 00:42:26,439
もう少しだけ待ってて
Please wait just a little longer.

340
00:42:29,099 --> 00:42:35,399
薄着でただそばに立っていても 不必要に汗をかいてしまう僕なんかもう
Even standing right by your side in light clothes, someone like me who sweats unnecessarily...

341
00:42:36,639 --> 00:42:42,399
どうしたって生ぬるくて 君を傷つけてしまうのだろう
Why is it that I'm always lukewarm and end up hurting you?

342
00:42:44,219 --> 00:42:47,819
手のひらが熱いほど 心は冷たいんでしょ
The warmer my palms are, the colder my heart must be, right?

343
00:42:48,519 --> 00:42:50,879
冗談でもそんな残酷なこと言わないでよ
Don't say such cruel things, even as a joke.

344
00:42:51,719 --> 00:42:59,679
別に冷えればいいけど 全人生を賭けても ちゃんと覆すさしてよ 救いたい 救われたい このイコールが今
It's fine if I freeze, but even if I bet my whole life, let me properly overturn this. I want to save, I want to be saved—this equation right now...

345
00:43:00,339 --> 00:43:06,099
優しく剥がしていくんだよ
is gently peeling away.

346
00:43:06,939 --> 00:43:13,579
堅い理論武装 プライドの過剰包装
Stiff theoretical armor, over-packaging of pride.

347
00:43:14,839 --> 00:43:20,999
正しさよりも優しさが欲しい そしてそれを受け取れるのは
I want kindness more than correctness. And the one who can receive that...

348
00:43:21,599 --> 00:43:31,159
イルミネーションみたいな 不特定多数じゃなくて ただ1人 君であってほしい
is not an indefinite crowd like illumination, but I want it to be just you, one and only.

349
00:43:44,899 --> 00:43:50,599
かけた言葉で 割れた日々を直そうとして
Trying to fix the fractured days with the words I uttered,

350
00:43:51,439 --> 00:43:58,799
足しすぎた熱量で 引かれてしまったカーテン
a curtain was drawn shut by too much fervor.

351
00:43:59,459 --> 00:44:13,399
そんな失敗作を 重ねて重ねて重ねて見つけたいんだいつか 最高の一句を
Stacking up such botched attempts over and over, I want to find it someday—the ultimate phrase.

352
00:44:15,059 --> 00:44:30,399
言葉はまるで雪の結晶 君にプレゼントしたとしても 時間が経ってしまえば大抵 記憶から流れ落ちて溶けていって 消えてしまう でも
Words are just like snowflakes. Even if I present them to you, as time passes, they mostly spill from memory, melt away, and disappear. But...

353
00:44:30,519 --> 00:44:36,639
絶えず僕らのストーリーに 添えられた字幕のように
like subtitles accompanying our unending story...

354
00:44:37,379 --> 00:44:44,539
思い返した時 不意に目をやる時に
When looking back, when suddenly casting my eyes upon it...

355
00:44:45,399 --> 00:45:00,064
君の胸を震わすもの 探し続けたい 愛してるよりも愛が届くまで 愛が届くまでは もう少しだけ
I want to keep searching for what makes your heart tremble. Until my love reaches you, even more than saying I love you, until my love reaches you... just a little longer.

356
00:45:00,422 --> 00:45:05,272
色は匂へど 散りぬるを いつか散りぬるを
Though colors fade and scatter, eventually scattering away...

357
00:45:06,272 --> 00:45:10,222
さまよう ことさえ
I couldn't even forgive...

358
00:45:10,222 --> 00:45:16,872
許せなかった… 勝手に彼のそばで
...wandering by your side on my own,

359
00:45:17,072 --> 00:45:21,572
あれこれと考えてる
pondering this and that...

360
00:45:21,572 --> 00:45:27,572
雪が溶けても 残ってる
Even as the snow melts, it remains...

361
00:45:44,872 --> 00:45:50,372
色は匂へど 散りぬるを いつか散りぬるを
Though colors fade and scatter, eventually scattering away...

362
00:45:51,272 --> 00:45:58,572
さまよう 事さえ 許せなかった…
I couldn't even forgive wandering...

363
00:46:15,572 --> 00:46:21,872
咲き誇る花は いつか 教えてくれた
The flowers in full bloom once taught me...

364
00:46:22,072 --> 00:46:29,872
生きるだけでは 罪と 離れられない 離せはしないと
that merely living is a sin, and that I cannot, will not let you go.

365
00:46:30,072 --> 00:46:43,572
抱く想いは 心を 踊らせるばかり
The feelings I hold only make my heart dance.

366
00:46:45,072 --> 00:46:51,872
色は匂へど 散りぬるを いつか散りぬるを
Though colors fade and scatter, eventually scattering away...

367
00:46:52,072 --> 00:46:58,572
さまよう 暇はない けれども 後退り
There's no time to wander, yet I step back...

368
00:46:59,072 --> 00:47:13,072
甘えるかの弱さで 悪夢が優しく 私を弄ぶ
With the weakness of wanting to lean on you, nightmares playfully tease me with kindness.

369
00:47:28,872 --> 00:47:35,072
弱さ知る アナタは 今 許してくれた
You, who know weakness, have now forgiven me...

370
00:47:35,572 --> 00:47:49,572
求める者の欲を 健気に咲いた 刹那の美しさ
The desires of one who seeks, blooming bravely, the beauty of a fleeting moment.

371
00:47:50,072 --> 00:47:55,872
それを知るには 遅すぎたのかもしれない…
Perhaps it was too late to realize that...

372
00:47:56,572 --> 00:48:02,572
色は匂へど 散りぬるを アナタの
Though colors fade and scatter, upon all of you...

373
00:48:03,072 --> 00:48:09,572
すべてに 幼く 委ねたい 許せぬ優しさと
childishly wanting to surrender myself, with an unforgiving gentleness...

374
00:48:10,072 --> 00:48:24,572
揺るぐ独占欲は 儚いに かけれぬ 我儘な愛
and a wavering possessiveness, a selfish love that cannot be measured in vanity.

375
00:48:46,872 --> 00:48:52,872
色は匂へど 散りぬるを すべて 散りぬるを
Though colors fade and scatter, everything scatters away...

376
00:48:53,572 --> 00:48:59,872
短き 記憶に 溢れる 想いは 枯れゆく
overflowing in brief memories, thoughts of a withering...

377
00:49:00,072 --> 00:49:16,572
命よ 儚く 強くあれ 無慈悲で 優しき 時のように
O life, be fleeting yet strong, like merciless and gentle time.

378
00:49:32,072 --> 00:49:41,572
Blessing 響くよ Every day Blessing for your everyday
Blessing ringing out every day, Blessing for your everyday...

379
00:49:50,072 --> 00:49:56,572
話してもなぜだか 増えてくタクト ランク付けされてく不条理な価値
Even when we talk, somehow our scores keep increasing, an unreasonable sense of value being ranked...

380
00:49:56,572 --> 00:50:00,072
そんなもの
Things like that...

381
00:50:00,160 --> 00:50:04,280
でっかい体でとびかう言葉を追って隠した
Chasing the big words flying around, hiding them...

382
00:50:07,530 --> 00:50:11,280
灯火を消す前に足元を照らせ
Light up your steps before putting out the lamp

383
00:50:12,180 --> 00:50:16,280
Blessing for your birthday, Blessing for your everyday

384
00:50:16,880 --> 00:50:20,580
ほらここをじっと見つめてみて
Look, gaze right here...

385
00:50:20,780 --> 00:50:24,580
最高の味方が映ってるでしょ
Your best allies are reflected, right?

386
00:50:24,830 --> 00:50:29,880
それは命の証
That is proof of life

387
00:50:29,880 --> 00:50:33,880
Blessing for your birthday, Blessing for your everyday

388
00:50:34,080 --> 00:50:38,280
たとえ明日世界が滅んでも
Even if the world were to perish tomorrow

389
00:50:38,280 --> 00:50:42,280
Blessing for your birthday, Blessing for your everyday

390
00:50:42,580 --> 00:50:46,880
最後の一秒まで前を向け
Look forward until the very last second

391
00:50:46,880 --> 00:50:52,280
Hip! Hop! Yay! これから先も Hip! Hop! Yay! 君に幸あれ
Hip! Hop! Yay! From now on too, Hip! Hop! Yay! May fortune be with you

392
00:50:52,280 --> 00:50:56,580
Hip! Hop! Yay! これから先も Hip! Hop! Yay! 君に幸あれ
Hip! Hop! Yay! From now on too, Hip! Hop! Yay! May fortune be with you

393
00:51:04,280 --> 00:51:08,580
ゼロから一を生むのはたやすいこと
Creating one from zero is no easy task

394
00:51:09,280 --> 00:51:13,580
肝心なもんは見えないし静まれないこと
The important things cannot be seen, and you cannot quiet down

395
00:51:14,080 --> 00:51:17,880
不幸とはし合わせたと気づけないこと
Misfortune is not realizing when you are happy

396
00:51:18,080 --> 00:51:22,280
毎日が誕生日で毎日なこと
Every day being a birthday and an everyday thing

397
00:51:22,280 --> 00:51:26,580
Go, Stand up, 腕をかき分けて
Go, Stand up, push your arms through

398
00:51:26,580 --> 00:51:30,280
明日の花は咲く
Tomorrow's flowers will bloom

399
00:51:30,580 --> 00:51:34,880
ほらここに手を重ねてみて
Look, stack your hands right here...

400
00:51:35,080 --> 00:51:39,080
温もりが伝わってくるでしょ
Warmth will be transmitted, won't it?

401
00:51:39,080 --> 00:51:42,880
それは命の証
That is proof of life

402
00:51:42,880 --> 00:51:47,580
Blessing for your birthday, Blessing for your everyday

403
00:51:48,080 --> 00:51:52,280
どんな綺麗な理由だって構わない
Any beautiful reason is fine

404
00:51:52,280 --> 00:51:56,580
Blessing for your birthday, Blessing for your everyday

405
00:51:56,580 --> 00:52:01,280
この世に産まれてくれてありがとう
Thank you for being born into this world

406
00:52:01,280 --> 00:52:05,580
Hip! Hop! Yay! これから先も Hip! Hop! Yay! 君に幸あれ
Hip! Hop! Yay! From now on too, Hip! Hop! Yay! May fortune be with you

407
00:52:06,580 --> 00:52:10,580
Hip! Hop! Yay! これから先も Hip! Hop! Yay! 君に幸あれ
Hip! Hop! Yay! From now on too, Hip! Hop! Yay! May fortune be with you

408
00:52:11,280 --> 00:52:16,880
さあさ寄ってらっしゃい見てらっしゃい Rockでいったらこんな風
Come on, step right up and see, if it were Rock, it'd be like this

409
00:52:16,880 --> 00:52:21,080
泣いてばっかでいったらこんな風 Like this, like this, yeah!
If you were just crying, it'd be like this, Like this, like this, yeah!

410
00:52:21,080 --> 00:52:25,580
げんきでいったらこんな風 Life is, like is, yeah!
If you were energetic, it'd be like this, Life is, like is, yeah!

411
00:52:25,580 --> 00:52:28,080
ダンスでいったらこんな風
If you were dancing, it'd be like this

412
00:52:28,080 --> 00:52:35,880
よく食べてよく眠ってよく遊んでよく学んでよく喋ってよく怪我して
Eating well, sleeping well, playing well, learning well, talking well, getting hurt well...

413
